  "prefLabel": "Per-A 204.03 Notification of Changes in Name, Address, Telephone Number, Fax Number and E-mail Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per-A 204.03 Notification of Changes in Name, Address, Telephone Number, Fax Number and E-mail Address. Parties, intervenors and their representatives shall notify the board of any change in their name, address, telephone number, fax number or e-mail address.\n\nSource. #9205, eff 10-23-08",
